        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Eco Packaging FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Is reuse better than recycling?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — reuse skips the energy and water of pulping and re-manufacturing entirely.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do customers care about eco packaging?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Majorities across Southeast Asia prefer it, strongest among younger shoppers.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Does going green cost more?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Not this way — used cartons cost 40-60% less than new from the first parcel.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">How do I present a reused box well?</summary>
