      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: The Rare Free Win</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">Most sustainability decisions trade cost for conscience. Reused carton boxes don't — they cut your packaging bill nearly in half, keep perfectly good board in circulation, and give your brand an honest green story to tell. Start with your non-display shipments and measure the savings after one month.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Browse used carton stock in our <a href="/shop" class="text-primary underline">shop</a>, or read more in our <a href="/blog/used-carton-boxes-malaysia" class="text-primary underline">used carton box guide</a>.</p>
      </section>
